14260      GOSUB *GET_TOKEN:USERDATA TOKEN$,0:FM_SR(L)=VAL(TOKEN$):'SR
14270      GOSUB *GET_TOKEN:USERDATA TOKEN$,0:FM_RR(L)=VAL(TOKEN$):'RR
