14320      GOSUB *GET_TOKEN:USERDATA TOKEN$,0:FM_DT(L)=VAL(TOKEN$):'dt
14330      GOSUB *GET_TOKEN:USERDATA TOKEN$,0:FM_KS(L)=VAL(TOKEN$):'KS
